        "summary": "创建即时交通事件",
        "description": "创建即时交通事件,平台分发即时交通事件给目标设备的接口。事件一旦创建便会立即下发且只会下发一次。",
        "operationId": "SendImmediateEvent",
        "schemes": [
          "https"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数说明**:项目ID。获取方法请参见 [获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-v2x/v2x_04_0031.html)。\n\n**取值范围**:仅支持数字,a到f的小写字母组合,长度32。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{32}$"
          },
          {
            "name": "Instance-Id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "\"**参数说明**:实例ID。dris物理实例的唯一标识。获取方法参见[获取Instance-Id](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-v2x/v2x_04_0030.html)。\n\n**取值范围**:仅支持数字,小写字母和横杠(-)的组合,长度36。\"",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-z0-9-]{36}$"
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
